@startuml
' Full domain model as the team drew it: the target after CR-1 (Human vs. AI).
' Not given to Bob. Used to compare each branch's code with the domain model, and for the talk.
title Tic-Tac-Toe — domain model (target after CR-1)
hide empty members

class TicTacToe
class Board
class Round
class Player
class Human
class AI
class Goal
class "Win: Row\ncolumn\nDiagonal\nInv Diagonal" as Win
class Put
class Square
class Piece
class Coordinate
class Color
class X
class O
class Empty

TicTacToe *-- Board
TicTacToe *-- Round
TicTacToe *-- "2" Player
Round -> "2" Player
Player --> Board
Player <|-- Human
Player <|-- AI
Player o-- Goal
Player o-- Color
Goal <|-- Win
Goal ..> Square
Goal ..> Put
Board *-- "3x3" Square
Put ..> Square : target
Put ..> Coordinate
Put ..> Piece
Square o-- Piece
Piece *-- Coordinate
Piece *-- Color
Color <|-- X
Color <|-- O
Color <|-- Empty
@enduml
